OL,3,GNEWSADrug courier, 19, found guilty of
OL,4,Amurdering teen with zombie knife
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage drug courier who stabbed a
OL,7,F17-year-old boy to death with a zombie
OL,8,Fknife has been found guilty of murder.
OL,10,FTristan Kerr was attacked with a 13.5cm
OL,11,F(5.3in) blade in February and collapsed
OL,12,Fand died outside a home in Abertridwr,
OL,13,FCaerphilly county.
OL,15,FGeorgie Mears, 19, from Cardiff, was
OL,16,Ffound guilty by a jury at Newport Crown
OL,17,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
