OL,5,
OL,6,FDrug dealer Conor Palfrey, 25, from
OL,7,FAbertriwdr, who also went to the flat
OL,8,Farmed with a stick, was found not
OL,9,Fguilty of murder through joint
OL,10,Fenterprise, but guilty of manslaughter.
